WEBVTT

00:07.341 --> 00:08.399
Subaru.

00:14.915 --> 00:15.813
Subaru!

00:29.063 --> 00:30.826
I'm sorry, Subaru.

00:32.099 --> 00:35.694
It's my fault that
you ended up like this.

00:38.272 --> 00:39.671
Please, come back.

00:54.155 --> 00:55.213
Hokuto.

01:31.325 --> 01:35.159
Episode 9
(Yin-Yang)

01:36.330 --> 01:38.321
Search for the Seven Seals?

01:38.432 --> 01:42.596
Yeah. I'm from Kouya,
you're from Ise,

01:42.703 --> 01:45.501
and Yuzuriha is
from Mitsumine Shrine.

01:45.606 --> 01:48.905
Three of the Seven Seals
are from our industry.

01:49.009 --> 01:50.374
Here, thanks for waiting.

01:50.477 --> 01:51.842
That means...

01:51.946 --> 01:55.473
...that the other
Dragons of Heaven might be, too.

01:55.583 --> 01:56.743
- Thanks.
- Yeah, thanks.

01:56.850 --> 02:00.547
And the first ones I thought
of are the Onmyouji.

02:02.389 --> 02:03.583
The Sumeragi clan.

02:03.691 --> 02:04.715
That's right.

02:04.825 --> 02:08.386
The Sumeragi clan is above
the Onmyouji existing today.

02:08.495 --> 02:11.521
The name of their 13th leader
is Subaru Sumeragi.

02:12.633 --> 02:16.865
I agree that the Sumeragi leader
has a high chance of being one.

02:16.971 --> 02:19.633
So where are you headed to?

02:19.740 --> 02:24.268
I sent a spell out to ask gramps
Stargazer how to contact them.

02:25.546 --> 02:26.672
And the reply?

02:26.780 --> 02:28.907
Well, nothing yet.

02:30.050 --> 02:33.178
So I thought it'd be a waste
to sit here and wait,

02:33.287 --> 02:35.551
and I asked
you out on a date.

02:38.192 --> 02:42.458
Lately, the takoyaki stands
in Tokyo fare pretty well.

02:42.563 --> 02:44.087
Would you like one, missie?

02:46.033 --> 02:47.898
Huh? Gee.

02:50.537 --> 02:52.129
What a cold shoulder!

02:57.378 --> 03:00.006
We are unable to come
to the phone now.

03:00.114 --> 03:05.313
Please, leave your message
after the beep.

03:08.188 --> 03:09.553
Subaru.

03:09.657 --> 03:16.221
The case I mentioned last week
has made an official inquiry.

03:16.330 --> 03:18.560
I'll send the location now.

03:20.701 --> 03:24.603
Are you still looking
for the Sakurazukamori?

03:27.074 --> 03:32.535
It's something that you, the leader
of the Sumeragi clan, decided.

03:32.646 --> 03:34.204
I will not stop you.

03:34.315 --> 03:38.513
I won't, but please do
take care of yourself.

03:55.669 --> 03:56.533
Something wrong?

03:56.637 --> 03:59.902
No, just thinking
how beautiful you are, missie.

04:00.007 --> 04:03.841
I thought you were contacting
the Sumeragi clan in Kyoto.

04:03.944 --> 04:05.912
As I said, I'm holding now.

04:07.181 --> 04:10.082
Apparently, their leader
isn't in Kyoto now.

04:10.184 --> 04:12.846
And they told me
to wait a minute.

04:12.953 --> 04:14.682
Is he really out of town?

04:17.057 --> 04:18.285
W-What?

04:18.392 --> 04:22.988
Perhaps they don't let him talk
to suspicious individuals.

04:23.097 --> 04:25.224
How am I suspicious?

04:25.332 --> 04:28.995
Where on Earth can you find
an honest and hard-working...

04:29.103 --> 04:29.967
Whoa...

04:30.070 --> 04:31.264
Y-Yes?

04:31.372 --> 04:32.737
No problem.

04:32.840 --> 04:36.367
Y-You're handing the phone
over to who?

04:36.477 --> 04:39.207
The previous Sumeragi leader?

04:42.249 --> 04:44.945
So you must be Sorata.

04:46.553 --> 04:48.953
Uh, yes. Yes.

04:49.056 --> 04:54.255
Can it be that gramps told her
about all the stunts I pulled?

04:54.361 --> 04:55.760
Actually...

04:55.863 --> 04:58.627
So it has begun, after all...

04:58.732 --> 05:02.395
the battle in Tokyo over
the fate of the world.

05:04.405 --> 05:09.502
He has to undergo many more
hardships again, doesn't he?

05:10.944 --> 05:13.208
Previous leader...

05:13.313 --> 05:15.247
Oh, that boy...

05:15.349 --> 05:19.843
No, our young leader
should be headed out by request.

05:19.953 --> 05:20.920
The location...

06:08.702 --> 06:09.964
Sumeragi here.

06:11.071 --> 06:13.369
I just arrived.

06:13.474 --> 06:14.998
I'll head over now.

06:17.344 --> 06:18.777
Yes, I see...

06:20.013 --> 06:22.846
Then I will be waiting for you.

09:42.115 --> 09:44.049
From what I hear,

09:44.151 --> 09:45.846
the young Sumeragi leader...

09:45.952 --> 09:50.286
...is one of the most powerful
in their long family history.

09:50.991 --> 09:54.483
Also,

09:54.594 --> 09:57.119
he apparently is
a really handsome guy!

09:57.230 --> 09:59.630
I hear he's really quiet though.

10:06.673 --> 10:09.039
I'm so glad
I'm a Dragon of Heaven!

10:09.142 --> 10:10.040
Why is that?

10:11.478 --> 10:13.503
Because they're all so beautiful!

10:49.349 --> 10:53.410
Well, now that Subaru's work
has finished up a little early...

10:54.521 --> 10:57.251
...let's swing by Shibuya,
and get some chocolate cake!

10:57.357 --> 10:59.416
I'd like to eat some mont-blanc.

11:25.352 --> 11:26.216
Subaru!

11:27.654 --> 11:28.780
Subaru!

11:28.889 --> 11:29.981
- Subaru!
- Subaru!

11:50.243 --> 11:53.212
You cannot kill me
at your power level.

11:54.281 --> 11:55.509
I know that.

11:55.615 --> 11:57.446
I can't win against you.

11:57.551 --> 12:01.043
But there's a spell
that only I can use.

12:01.154 --> 12:03.088
That only you can use?

12:04.191 --> 12:06.557
So you should kill me.

12:07.961 --> 12:09.223
I'll do just that.

12:20.173 --> 12:22.368
But the best Onmyouji,

12:22.475 --> 12:26.377
the Sumeragi leader
and the Sakurazukamori leader,

12:26.479 --> 12:28.276
are Dragons of
Heaven and Earth.

12:28.381 --> 12:30.508
Works out pretty well.

12:30.617 --> 12:33.245
Sumeragi in front,
Sakurazuka behind.

12:33.353 --> 12:35.651
I hear that their powers
are equal.

12:35.755 --> 12:37.723
Actually,
the young Sumeragi leader...

12:37.824 --> 12:40.759
...had something to do with
Sakurazukamori in the past.

12:40.861 --> 12:44.024
There might be some
grudge factor there.

13:59.506 --> 14:00.598
Hokuto!

14:03.376 --> 14:04.570
Subaru...

14:19.826 --> 14:20.918
Seishiro.

14:23.129 --> 14:25.188
I've been looking
for you all this time.

14:26.266 --> 14:27.164
Why?

14:29.636 --> 14:30.933
To make my wish...

14:32.038 --> 14:33.130
...a reality.

14:34.874 --> 14:35.932
Over there.

14:36.042 --> 14:37.669
Sure is easy to spot.

14:41.548 --> 14:43.311
A Barrier Field?

14:43.416 --> 14:44.678
The Seven Seals.

14:44.784 --> 14:48.720
No, the Sumeragi clan used
the term "Dragons of Heaven."

14:48.822 --> 14:51.586
Those that will save Earth
from destruction.

14:53.193 --> 14:57.254
I have no interest whatsoever
in the future of the Earth.

15:33.967 --> 15:35.832
Your wish...

15:35.935 --> 15:37.402
...is to kill me?

15:38.838 --> 15:43.400
Me, the one who killed
your dear elder sister.

15:46.413 --> 15:49.348
You really are a cute boy, Subaru.

16:24.617 --> 16:25.879
My wish is...

16:34.627 --> 16:35.924
Over there.

16:36.029 --> 16:39.055
All right, we'll finally meet him.

16:39.165 --> 16:40.063
Let's go!

16:48.808 --> 16:50.400
Wait just a minute.

16:55.715 --> 16:57.945
You put up a Barrier Field,
didn't you?

17:02.956 --> 17:05.516
This guy's got a handsome face,

17:05.625 --> 17:07.718
but he sure is unfriendly!

17:07.827 --> 17:08.885
Please wait.

17:10.296 --> 17:11.888
I am Arashi Kishu.

17:11.998 --> 17:15.627
And I'm this missie's
future sweet lover.

17:16.903 --> 17:18.768
Sorata Arisugawa.

17:18.872 --> 17:20.772
I am a Dragon
of Heaven who

17:20.874 --> 17:22.842
Princess Hinoto
the Dreamseer gathered.

17:22.942 --> 17:25.376
Would you like
to tell me your name?

17:26.479 --> 17:28.606
Subaru Sumeragi.

17:28.715 --> 17:30.580
The battle is beginning in Tokyo.

17:30.683 --> 17:32.310
Would you come with us?

17:35.755 --> 17:38.315
It looks like his job
isn't over yet.

17:40.026 --> 17:42.927
Well, why don't we
just wait for him?

17:51.938 --> 17:56.204
I am Sumeragi,
sent here by your request.

17:56.309 --> 17:58.334
I have been waiting for you.

18:27.173 --> 18:28.299
So it's you.

18:41.521 --> 18:42.613
Please.

18:43.890 --> 18:45.084
Is it all right?

18:46.492 --> 18:47.390
Yes.

18:50.430 --> 18:52.625
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

18:52.732 --> 18:54.927
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

18:55.034 --> 18:57.195
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

18:57.303 --> 18:59.533
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

18:59.639 --> 19:01.766
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:01.874 --> 19:04.001
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:04.110 --> 19:06.271
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:06.379 --> 19:08.609
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:08.715 --> 19:10.740
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:10.850 --> 19:12.909
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:13.019 --> 19:15.044
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:15.154 --> 19:17.247
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:17.357 --> 19:18.949
On kakaka bisan maei sowaka.

19:27.900 --> 19:31.165
She loved that man
so much that she would...

19:31.271 --> 19:35.173
...bring him back to life
using a forbidden spell.

19:35.275 --> 19:39.905
So much that she could release
her soul out of this world.

19:42.115 --> 19:44.948
But she might be happier this way.

19:46.719 --> 19:48.186
Because now...

19:48.288 --> 19:55.421
...she can continue to think only
about that one man in her heart.

19:56.496 --> 19:58.896
Only of the one she loves.

20:00.433 --> 20:05.234
That can only be done
by someone with an ailing heart.

20:05.338 --> 20:07.670
Why did you call for me then?

20:09.575 --> 20:13.705
Even if he was a dead man,
if it meant her happiness.

20:13.813 --> 20:18.341
But I didn't want
to hand her over to anyone.

20:19.552 --> 20:22.020
Even if it was a dead man.

20:25.458 --> 20:28.359
I am ailing myself, you see.

20:39.339 --> 20:42.172
Continuing to think
of just one person...

20:43.276 --> 20:45.710
...can only be done
by an ailing heart.

20:48.147 --> 20:49.205
Seishiro.
